1
00:00:00,824 --> 00:00:01,844
(Amy:)Ooh, that sounds like fun.

2
00:00:02,025 --> 00:00:05,655
(Penny:)You're kidding, right? We're not just
gonna get drunk and go on rides?

3
00:00:06,897 --> 00:00:08,767
(Amy:)Come on, do it with us.

4
00:00:08,932 --> 00:00:11,232
Ah, all right, whatever. How does it work?

5
00:00:11,401 --> 00:00:15,061
(Bernadette:)Okay, so you pick your princess,
Sleeping Beauty, Snow White, Cinderella.

6
00:00:15,272 --> 00:00:17,472
(Bernadette:)They give you hair, makeup, the works.

7
00:00:18,074 --> 00:00:20,664
I guess it would be fun to be Cinderella.

8
00:00:20,844 --> 00:00:22,974
(Amy:)- I want to be Cinderella too.
- Yeah.

9
00:00:23,146 --> 00:00:25,276
(Bernadette:)We can't all be Cinderella.

10
00:00:28,418 --> 00:00:29,678
(Amy:)Then how do we decide?

11
00:00:29,853 --> 00:00:34,013
(Bernadette:)Well, it's simple. This was my idea,
I'm driving, I'm Cinderella.

12
00:00:34,190 --> 00:00:37,520
(Bernadette:)You bitches got a problem with that,
we can stop the car right now.

13
00:00:50,373 --> 00:00:52,073
(Raj:)Excuse me.

14
00:00:52,242 --> 00:00:55,372
(Raj:)I'm meeting a girl here.
It's kind of a first date.

15
00:00:55,812 --> 00:00:57,942
(Man:)In a library?

16
00:00:59,082 --> 00:01:04,142
(Raj:)She and I are both a little awkward in social
situations so this seemed like a good idea.

